## Description
For no code indexing it is helpful for us to know which structs have the `#[event]` annotation. This PR adds the `is_event` field to structs in the ABI returned by the API (the JSON representation).

We have tentative plans to do a full overhaul of the ABI, but that will be a much larger effort, requiring a migration since the representation will be different in a breaking way. This PR is much less invasive, just a new field for this specific attribute.

Resolves this item in the no code indexing tracker: https://www.notion.so/aptoslabs/Add-is_event-to-ABI-f4eba0ff4b2645e88fb0ddb71b46a716?pvs=4.

